	<<npcincr Whitney lust -20>><<llust>>
	<br><br>

	"There," Whitney says, catching <<nnpc_his "Whitney">> breath. <<nnpc_He "Whitney">> adjusts <<nnpc_his "Whitney">> clothes slowly, one hand staying possessively on your waist. "That's my slut."

	/* Fishing Todo: random 50% chance that whitney either leaves or stays? */

