	<br><br>

	<<nnpc_He "Whitney">> nods at <<nnpc_his "Whitney">> friends and they wander back over. The group settles back into their spots along the railing like nothing happened.
	<br><br>
	/* Fishing Todo: Once you finish this combat, the gang should stick around. This means that I'll need to track the betting scene in a way separate from the phase.  */
	<<clotheson>>
	<<endcombat>>
	<<link [[Return to Fishing|Fishing Pier Wait]]>><<set $daily.fishing.pier.whitney.phase to "idle">><</link>>
	<br>
